    /// Get Upcoming Rewards
    ///
    /// Expected rewards for the pending rounds (started, not paid yet — up to 2, newest first; the
    /// same rounds as /api/v1/pool/validation_rounds) on the user's current tsTON: wallet (TonAPI)
    /// + DeFi positions (as in /breakdown).
    ///
    /// reward_ton = balance_tston * roi * rate. roi — of the round's R-2 (same validator set,
    /// parallel pair) from the wallet's Liquid feed with DeFi, as in /rewards-defi (`roi_source=round`);
    /// if the wallet had no tsTON in it or Liquid is down — the pool's on-chain projection, as the dapp
    /// (`roi_source=projected`). rate — current tsTON price.
    ///
